# AI Inbox Triage System

An AI-powered customer support workflow built with **LangChain Expression Language (LCEL)**. The application analyzes incoming customer queries, classifies them, routes them to the appropriate support workflow, and generates a refined customer response.

This project demonstrates how to build modular AI pipelines using LangChain chains, parallel execution, and conditional routing.

---

## Features

- Classifies customer queries into:
  - Billing
  - Technical Support
  - General Inquiry
- Detects customer sentiment
- Estimates urgency level (1–5)
- Executes multiple analysis tasks in parallel
- Routes requests to specialized response generators
- Refines the final response based on sentiment and urgency

---

## Workflow

```text
                Customer Query
                      │
                      ▼
            RunnableParallel
        ┌──────────┬──────────┬──────────┐
        │          │          │
Classifier   Sentiment    Urgency
        │          │          │
        └──────────┴──────────┘
                    │
                    ▼
               Build State
                    │
                    ▼
             RunnableBranch
        ┌──────────┼──────────┐
        │          │          │
 Billing   Technical   General
        │          │          │
        └──────────┴──────────┘
                    │
                    ▼
             Draft Response
                    │
                    ▼
           Response Refinement
                    │
                    ▼
             Final AI Response
```

---

## Project Structure

```
inbox-triage/
│
├── main.py
├── config.py
├── state.py
│
├── prompts/
│   ├── analysis_prompts.py
│   ├── draft_prompts.py
│   └── final_prompt.py
│
└── chains/
    ├── analysis.py
    ├── routing.py
    └── refinement.py
```

