---

## Installation

Clone the repository.

```bash
git clone <your-repository-url>
cd inbox-triage
```

Install dependencies.

```bash
pip install -r requirements.txt
```

Create a `.env` file.

```text
OPENAI_API_KEY=your_api_key
```

Run the project.

```bash
python main.py
```

---

## Example Input

```text
Payment was deducted twice.
```

## Example Analysis

```text
Category   : Billing
Sentiment  : Negative
Urgency    : 4
```

## Example Output

```text
We’re sorry to hear about the issue.

Could you please share your Transaction ID, payment receipt, and the date of payment? Our billing team will investigate the duplicate charge and work to resolve it as quickly as possible.
```

