## Learning Outcomes

This project helped me understand:

- Designing AI workflows using LangChain
- Running multiple LLM tasks in parallel
- Building state-driven pipelines
- Dynamic routing using RunnableBranch
- Prompt engineering for different stages of a workflow
- Organizing LangChain applications into reusable modules

